  "abstract": {
    "value": "In the past, we reported an efficient synthesis of substituted allenes by reaction of lithium dimethylcopper with acetylenic acetates $^{2}$. Numerous other preparations of allenes through the use of organometallic reagents (1) on propargylic esters (2) have been reported $^{3-6}$. Besides the expected propadiene (3), a non-alkylated allene (4) has sometimes been isolated, the origin of which remained obscure.",
